{"title": "Infernal Legion", "pageid": 28313, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Infernal_Legion", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Infernal Legion</b> is a passive feature that makes the wearer a part of the legion.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/27px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/41px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Legion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/27px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\">Infernal Legion</a> condition while worn. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Infernal_Legion\"> Condition: Infernal Legion </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Legion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\">Infernal Legion</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>You are one, you are legion, without personality or individuality - born only to fight.</li>\n<li>When within 20 m (67 ft) of another creature wearing a merregon's mask, <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> increases by 1 and <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> decrease by 1 per nearby mask.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devilfoil_Mask\" title=\"Devilfoil Mask\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Devilfoil_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Devilfoil_Mask\" title=\"Devilfoil Mask\">Devilfoil Mask</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Legion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Infernal_Legion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Legion_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Legion (Condition)\">Infernal Legion</a> condition is only applied if the mask's wearer is within range other creatures wearing a mask. It gains one stack for each mask within range, not including the wearer themself. It is also not displayed on the mask's tooltip in-game.</li>\n<li>Infernal Legion grants an uncapped bonus to Strength, but <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities#Priority\" title=\"Abilities\">takes effect before</a> other items and bonuses which raise Strength to a capped amount.</li>\n<li>Sometimes, upon a character level up, the Infernal Legion buff disappears; this can be corrected by unequipping and re-equipping the mask.</li>\n<li>The Infernal Legion buff disappears if a Druid wearing the mask uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204805\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1936/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18836/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6662/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 969609/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.776      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   48.776      1 -total\n 27.02%   13.181      4 Template:Icon_link\n 26.53%   12.938    